    <strong>Interpretation note:</strong> Reviews per month is an imperfect demand proxy. It undercounts actual bookings (not all guests leave reviews) and is biased by stay length (shorter stays generate more reviews per booking). Rome's high value likely reflects a combination of strong tourism demand and shorter average stays.
  </div>
